{"n": 674, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "674.webp", "text": "34-30\n\n(cont. of 34 52 520)\nAcceleration Pick-up for ABS:\n\nAdjusting\n\nRequirements:\n\nCar parked on level ground (workshop floor}\nCar including trunk empty.\n\nFuel tank full (or equal weight in trunk)\nTire inflation pressure correct.\n\nPlace Special Tool 34 5 150 with acceleration\npick-up (in installed position) and test lead\n\n61 1 440 on console in car.\n\nConnect ohmmeter (M 06) of BMW service\ntester with test lead.\n\nNominal value: less than 1 k-ohm,\n\nIncrease angle (1) of special tool with screw (2)\nso long, until ohmmeter displays more than\n2.5 M-ohms.\n\nRemove Special Tool 34 5 150 and measure\ndistance (A).\n\nCompare actual value with nominal value\ntable.\n\nIf measured value is within tolerances, install\nacceleration pick-up without shim,\n\nIf measured value is not within tolerances,\ndetermine thickness of shim,\n\nExamples:\n\nActual value 35.6 mm (1.401\")\nMaximum value 33.0 mm (1.299)\nMin. shim thickness 2.6 mm (0.102\")\nor\n\nActual value 35.6 mm (1.401\")\nMinimum value 26.5 mm (1,043\")\nMax. shim thickness 9.1 mm (0.358\")\n\n3034 2078\n\nIf the measured actual value 2 smaller than the\nnominal value, install the shim on mounting\npornt (1)\n\nIf the measured actual value is larger than the\nnominal value, install the shim on mounting\npoint (2)\n\nInstall shim of determined thickness between\nthe console and special tool,\n\nRecheck switching point\n\nIf switching point is now within tolerances,\nremove special tool and install acceleration\n\npick up with shim and shear off screws\n\nTighten shear-off screws and lock by shearing\noff the heads.\n\nTightening torque: 6 to 8 Nm (4.5 to 5 § ft. ths}\n\nNominal Value Table\n\nFor adjusting acceleration pick-up in car and checking acceleration pick-up\n\n20 34 206\n\nDistance \"A\" in mm -\n26.5\nPermissible switching\n\ntolerance of accelera-\ntion pick-up in car\n\nA maximum of one wedge and three shims (a = 1 mm / 0.039\") may be used on one mounting\nbolt to correct the switching point of the acceleration pick-up in the car,\nIf the switching point of an acceleration pick-up in the car is beyond the maximum shim range,\n\nthe console must be corrected.\n\nThe wedge, Part No. 34 51 1 156 827, is equal to 4.9 ... 5.3 mm (0.193 to 0.209\").", "words": [["34-30", 0.465, 0.0199, 0.5279, 0.0431], ["(cont.", 0.2634, 0.0597, 0.2903, 0.071], ["of", 0.2943, 0.0597, 0.3045, 0.071], ["34", 0.3085, 0.0597, 0.3197, 0.0703], ["52", 0.3232, 0.0597, 0.3354, 0.071], ["520)", 0.3384, 0.0597, 0.3602, 0.071], ["Acceleration", 0.2624, 0.0763, 0.3232, 0.0862], ["Pick-up", 0.3273, 0.0756, 0.3622, 0.0889], ["for", 0.3652, 0.0756, 0.3784, 0.0862], ["ABS:", 0.3825, 0.0756, 0.4068, 0.0862], ["Adjusting", 0.2624, 0.1081, 0.309, 0.1207], ["Requirements:", 0.2634, 0.1399, 0.3328, 0.1525], ["Car", 0.2624, 0.1552, 0.2786, 0.1671], ["parked", 0.2822, 0.1558, 0.3151, 0.1684], ["on", 0.3181, 0.1585, 0.3303, 0.1664], ["level", 0.3338, 0.1558, 0.3546, 0.1664], ["ground", 0.3576, 0.1558, 0.3911, 0.1684], ["(workshop", 0.3951, 0.1558, 0.4453, 0.1684], ["floor}", 0.4488, 0.1558, 0.4752, 0.1671], ["Car", 0.2624, 0.1718, 0.2781, 0.1824], ["including", 0.2827, 0.1724, 0.3267, 0.185], ["trunk", 0.3303, 0.1724, 0.3551, 0.1824], ["empty.", 0.3592, 0.1737, 0.3921, 0.1844], ["Fuel", 0.2634, 0.1883, 0.2837, 0.1989], ["tank", 0.2877, 0.1883, 0.308, 0.1989], ["full", 0.3121, 0.1883, 0.3283, 0.1989], ["(or", 0.3323, 0.1877, 0.3455, 0.1996], ["equal", 0.3485, 0.1883, 0.3739, 0.2003], ["weight", 0.3774, 0.1883, 0.4088, 0.2016], ["in", 0.4124, 0.191, 0.4205, 0.1983], ["trunk)", 0.4245, 0.1883, 0.4539, 0.1989], ["Tire", 0.2634, 0.2042, 0.2817, 0.2149], ["inflation", 0.2857, 0.2042, 0.3262, 0.2149], ["pressure", 0.3298, 0.2069, 0.3678, 0.2168], ["correct.", 0.3713, 0.2056, 0.4073, 0.2149], ["Place", 0.2609, 0.2924, 0.2872, 0.311], ["Special", 0.2913, 0.2924, 0.3242, 0.311], ["Tool", 0.3278, 0.2951, 0.3495, 0.3064], ["34", 0.3536,